</table>
<p id="S4.SS4.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="S4.SS4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{d}</annotation></semantics></math> maps retained hidden dimensions to the common target width and
<math id="S4.SS4.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}_{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}_{d}</annotation></semantics></math> restores the spatial grid. In MMDiT, the action applies only to
