subset still has exactly <math id="S4.SS4.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math> coordinates. Model cards are linked for
<a href="https://huggingface.co/runwayml/stable-diffusion-v1-5" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">SD-1.5</a>,
<a href="https://huggingface.co/PixArt-alpha/PixArt-Sigma-XL-2-1024-MS" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">PixArt-<math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></a>,
and <a href="https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-3.5-medium" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">SD3.5
Medium</a>.</p>
</div>
