<div id="S4.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SS4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We instantiate the transformer interfaces with PixArt-<math id="S4.SS4.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math>
<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib4" title="" class="ltx_ref">Chen et al., 2024</a>)</cite> and SD3.5 MMDiT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib8" title="" class="ltx_ref">Esser et al., 2024</a>)</cite>. The matched fractions
in Table <a href="#S4.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 4.4 Transformer teachers ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Policy-Mask: Budget-Aware Adaptation of Diffusion Features to Discriminative Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> lie between
<math id="S4.SS4.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="9.98\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>9.98</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">9.98\%</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S4.SS4.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10.03\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>10.03</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10.03\%</annotation></semantics></math> of the available feature width. This keeps the hard
selection pressure comparable when a U-Net channel axis is replaced by a
transformer hidden-dimension axis. The table is therefore evidence for the
interface under a matched capacity fraction, not a ranking based on raw model
width. It is reported separately from Tables <a href="#S4.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ 4.2 Main results ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Policy-Mask: Budget-Aware Adaptation of Diffusion Features to Discriminative Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>
and <a href="#S4.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 4.2 Main results ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Policy-Mask: Budget-Aware Adaptation of Diffusion Features to Discriminative Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>. No numerical contrast is drawn across these
teacher-specific evaluations.</p>
</div>
